      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Skip the NVIDIA probe on non-NVIDIA jobs**\n\nWhen this file is collected by the required CPU workflow (`.github/workflows/cpu-torch-latest.yml:252-257` runs all of `unit/`), `nvidia-smi` is not installed, but this call executes unconditionally and raises `FileNotFoundError`; the CUDA availability guard in the second test never protects this test. Gate the probe on an NVIDIA environment or move it into the NVIDIA-only sandbox controller.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
