      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Run the probe for every sandbox invocation**\n\nAfter this commit is merged, normal merge-queue runs use subset selection and execute exactly the impacted test files (`.github/workflows/TEST_SELECTION.md:176-188`). The selector only includes this standalone test when the test itself changes (`ci/tests_fetcher.py:543-567`), so unrelated future changes—the runs for which a fleet driver regression must be diagnosed—will not execute the probe at all. Put the report in the sandbox controller's unconditional pre-pytest commands rather than relying on test selection.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.",
